```

#### GET /messages/:id/attachments/:attachmentId - Download Attachment
Returns binary file with appropriate Content-Type header.

---

### Domains

#### GET /domains - List Domains
```json
// Response 200
[
  {
    "id": "uuid",
    "name": "manhquy.click",
