```

#### PUT /webhooks/:id - Update Webhook
```json
// Request
{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "url": "https://new-url.com/webhook",
  "events": ["email.received", "email.deleted"],
  "isActive": true
}
```

#### DELETE /webhooks/:id - Delete Webhook
