```

#### GET /webhooks/:id/logs - Get Delivery Logs
```json
// Response 200
[
  {
    "id": "uuid",
    "eventType": "email.received",
    "statusCode": 200,
    "duration": 150,
    "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
  }
]
